{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791425760, "covers_from": "2026-10-08T02:16:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-08T02:17:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791425820, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-08T02:16:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16208, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "抽煙人士根本無懼無視禁煙標誌，直接在禁煙標誌前抽煙，抽煙沒有好處還直接損害他人，希望台北變成無菸首都", "display_name": "信義代表 Angie 詩語", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T02:16:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35050, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "長照", "content": "我的暱稱是「老有所終，壯有所用，幼有所長」例如：假設所有長者都可領3千，但設計誘因，只要長者從事一些", "display_name": "松山代表 Jay", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T02:16:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22172, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "暫停服務的Ubike卻還是顯示在地圖上，走到站點才發現雖然有車，卻暫停服務無法騎乘", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.22,172", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T02:16:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 14762, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "環境", "content": "老鼠真的太多了，不只是髒亂的問題，常常看到被車子輾過的老鼠貼紙，也是非常於心不忍跟傷心（也很血腥）", "display_name": "北投代表 Tefi", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 35050, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 Jay", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 22172, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.22,172", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 14762, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 Tefi", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 13975, "sprite_key": "giraffe_culture", "display